  "config.promaid.build.noForceHome": "No forced home in build mode",
  "config.promaid.build.noForceHome.tooltip": "No forced home in build mode (default on): during building / marker-stone temporary construction she is no longer switched into home (garrison) mode. Instead the mod blocks every NON-player-willed auto-teleport at its source (TLM follow teleport / same-dimension long-range pullback / cross-dimension auto-follow / owner-death recall / self-preservation return), so she stays on the site. Manual summon, schedule 'teleport to me', stuck-rescue and the build's own teleport still work. Off = revert to old behavior (build forces home and swallows all auto-teleports).",
  "item.maid_smart.da_yun": "Dayun (Accessory)",
  "item.maid_smart.da_yun.desc1": "§7While gliding with an §felytra§7 it instantly destroys blocks within §f5×5×5§7 around you",
  "item.maid_smart.da_yun.desc2": "§7Blocks with hardness §f≥ obsidian (50)§7 or §f< 0§7 (bedrock/barrier/command block...) are never touched",
  "item.maid_smart.da_yun.desc3": "§7Anything with a block entity — §fcontainers§7 (chest/furnace/hopper/shulker/spawner...) — is skipped entirely; normal blocks §fdrop as in vanilla",
  "item.maid_smart.da_yun.desc4": "§7Maid: put it in §fher own bauble slot§7 and it works §fonly in air-raid mode§7. Player: put it in a §fCurios slot§7 and it works while you glide (requires Curios). Craft: 4 iron blocks + 2 diamond blocks + 2 redstone blocks + 1 minecart",
